# Amazon EC2 Auto Scaling User Guide

> Use Amazon EC2 Auto Scaling to launch or terminate EC2 instances based on automatic scaling and health status.

- [Set up](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/autoscaling/ec2/userguide/setting-up.md)
- [Working with AWS SDKs](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/autoscaling/ec2/userguide/sdk-general-information-section.md)
- [Working with the APIs](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/autoscaling/ec2/userguide/ec2-auto-scaling-api.md)
- [Related information](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/autoscaling/ec2/userguide/as-resources.md)
- [Document history](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/autoscaling/ec2/userguide/DocumentHistory.md)

