Learn how to create a target tracking scaling policy to scale your Auto Scaling group using your Amazon SQS queue backlog.

- [Configure scaling based on Amazon SQS](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/autoscaling/ec2/userguide/scale-sqs-queue-cli.md): The following procedure describes how to configure automatic scaling based on Amazon SQS.
